Nothing in this Code or the ordinance adopting this Code shall be construed to affect the validity of any ordinance or portion thereof pertaining to the following not in this Code, which ordinances designated continue in full force and effect to the same extent as if published at length herein:
(1) Any ordinance adopting or amending a comprehensive plan;
(2) Any ordinance authorizing or approving any contract, deed or agreement;
(3) Any ordinance authorizing or directing public improvements to be made, or creating districts for public improvements of any kind or nature;
(4) Any ordinance authorizing the issuance of bonds or other instruments of indebtedness, or promising or guaranteeing the payment of money;
(5) Any ordinance dedicating, accepting or vacating any plat or subdivision;
(6) Any ordinance dedicating, establishing, naming, renaming, locating, relocating, opening, paving, widening, narrowing, repairing, accepting, vacating or discontinuing any road, street, public way, alley, avenue or boulevard;
(7) Any ordinance describing or altering the boundaries of the city, or annexing or de-annexing property;
(8) Any ordinance establishing or changing the grade, curbline or width of any road, street, public way, alley, avenue or boulevard;
(9) Any ordinance granting any right, franchise or easement;
(10) Any ordinance making, amending, or approving any appropriation or budget;
(11) Any ordinance naming or renaming a park or recreational facility;
(12) Any ordinance pertaining to any city internal personnel, department or administrative policies;
(13) Any ordinance providing for salaries, compensation or other officer or employee benefits;
(14) Any ordinance relating to the acquisition of property or interests in property by gift, purchase, devise, bequest, appropriation or condemnation;
(15) Any ordinance rezoning specific property, amending the zoning map or otherwise pertaining to zoning;
(16) Any ordinance that is an administrative ordinance or resolution of the city not in conflict or inconsistent with the provisions of this Code;
(17) Any ordinance that is not included herein that levies or imposes special assessments;
(18) Any ordinance that is not included herein that levies or imposes taxes;
(19) Any ordinance that is special, although permanent in effect;
(20) Any ordinance that is temporary, although general in effect; or
(21) Any ordinance the purpose of which has been accomplished.

